# Images

This directory contains the visualizations created from the SQL query results used in the IMDb SQL Analysis project.

The charts provide a visual summary of the key findings presented in the project's main `README.md`.

## Contents

| Image | Related Query | Description |
|-------|---------------|-------------|
| `runtime_vs_rating.png` | **1.2** | Average IMDb rating across runtime buckets. |
| `avg_rating_trend_across_decade.png` | **1.3** | Trend of average IMDb ratings across release decades. |
| `pct_of_high_rated_movies_by_runtime.png` | **2.1** | Percentage of highly rated movies (IMDb ≥ 8) across runtime buckets. |
| `genre_performance.png` | **3.1** | Average IMDb rating across individual genres. |
| `top_directors_wrt_ratings.png` | **5.1** | Directors ranked by average IMDb rating after applying the analysis criteria. |

## Purpose

These visualizations complement the SQL analysis by making important trends easier to interpret and compare. They are referenced throughout the project's main `README.md` and summarize the principal findings of the analysis.
